      <h3 class="headline mt-10 !text-ink">How Our Scam Checker and Fraud Detection Tool Works</h3>
      <p>
        ScamLens is a unified <strong>scam detector</strong> with one checker that auto-detects what you paste. Choose <strong>Message</strong> for copied text, <strong>Screenshot</strong> for PNG/JPG/WEBP images (up to 10MB), or <strong>Link</strong> for any URL. The checker analyses the input in seconds — text and links instantly, screenshots with local processing — looking for proven fraud signals: urgency, fear, reward bait, payment requests, OTP/PIN/password requests, impersonation of banks/couriers/government, suspicious shorteners, and social-engineering cues. Each finding is tied to an evidence quote from your input, for example <code class="evidence-pill">“Pay Rs 99 to reschedule”</code> flagged as a payment request. The final verdict is Low, Medium, High, or Critical — always explained, never invented.
      </p>

      <h3 class="headline mt-10 !text-ink">Fake Website Checker — Verify Website Safety Instantly</h3>
