        Wondering <strong>how to check if a website is a scam</strong> before you enter card details? Use ScamLens as your <strong>fake website checker</strong>. Paste any suspicious URL and our <strong>URL scam checker</strong> inspects its structure locally without opening it in your browser. It flags shorteners that hide destinations, look-alike domains like <code class="evidence-pill">hdfcbank-secure-login.xyz</code> versus the real <code class="evidence-pill">hdfcbank.com</code>, punycode spoofs, raw IP hosts, insecure http links, hidden “@”-style credential tricks and direct APK downloads. This is the safest way to <strong>verify website safety</strong> for shopping, banking, or government portals — you never risk loading a malicious site yourself.
      </p>

